From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wolf Vollprecht <w.vollprecht@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 17:10:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dope: isaac_ros_tensor_rt is a runtime dependency, not a build
 one

isaac_ros_dope builds exactly one target, dope_decoder_node, from one source file.
That file and its header include, in full:

    ament_index_cpp, Eigen/Dense, geometry_msgs, isaac_ros_common/qos.hpp,
    isaac_ros_nitros/nitros_node.hpp,
    isaac_ros_nitros_tensor_list_type/nitros_tensor_list.hpp,
    isaac_ros_tensor_list_interfaces, opencv2, rclcpp, rclcpp_components,
    sensor_msgs, tf2_ros, vision_msgs

Not one header from isaac_ros_tensor_rt. The decoder reads a TensorList off a topic
and solves PnP on it; the inference is done by a separate composable node that
isaac_ros_dope.launch.py puts in the same container. That is a launch-graph
relationship, and `<exec_depend>` is how package format 3 expresses it.

Declaring it as `<depend>` instead has a concrete cost, because
ament_auto_find_build_dependencies() turns every `<depend>` into a REQUIRED
find_package: isaac_ros_dope cannot be *configured* without TensorRT present, even
though it cannot *use* TensorRT. Anywhere TensorRT is unavailable -- an
unaccelerated CI runner, a platform NVIDIA does not ship libnvinfer for, a
conda/RoboStack packaging of the stack -- a package that needs nothing but OpenCV
and NITROS is unbuildable for a dependency it never calls. ament_auto_add_library
also links every found dependency, so the shipped .so picks up a DT_NEEDED on the
TensorRT node library it has no symbol from.

Demoting to `<exec_depend>` keeps `rosdep install` and the launch files exactly as
they were -- exec dependencies are still installed -- and makes the build need only
what the code includes.
---
 isaac_ros_dope/package.xml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/isaac_ros_dope/package.xml b/isaac_ros_dope/package.xml
--- a/isaac_ros_dope/package.xml
+++ b/isaac_ros_dope/package.xml
@@ -41,13 +41,13 @@

   <depend>isaac_ros_dnn_image_encoder</depend>
   <depend>isaac_ros_nitros</depend>
   <depend>isaac_ros_nitros_camera_info_type</depend>
   <depend>isaac_ros_nitros_tensor_list_type</depend>
   <depend>isaac_ros_tensor_list_interfaces</depend>
-  <depend>isaac_ros_tensor_rt</depend>
+  <exec_depend>isaac_ros_tensor_rt</exec_depend>
   <depend>python3-torch-pip-shim</depend>
   <depend>python3-onnx-pip-shim</depend>
   <depend>python3-onnxscript-pip-shim</depend>

   <depend>rclcpp</depend>
   <depend>sensor_msgs</depend>
